00:00:38.168 --> 00:00:39.901
- Crunch it, oh oh!

00:00:39.901 --> 00:00:40.734
- Oh!

00:00:41.892 --> 00:00:43.462
- Oh, it tastes worse.

00:00:43.462 --> 00:00:46.199
- Uh, it tastes like a vitamin C tablet.

00:00:46.199 --> 00:00:47.267
- Yeah it does.

00:00:47.267 --> 00:00:49.787
- This is like asking
for your dog or your baby

00:00:49.787 --> 00:00:53.315
to just be like a click
click (mimicking gargling).

00:00:53.315 --> 00:00:57.981
Now my insides are glittery
and my poop looks like gold.

00:00:57.981 --> 00:01:00.372
- Boom, toothie tabs.

00:01:00.372 --> 00:01:01.205
- It's charcoal?

00:01:01.205 --> 00:01:02.253
- It's charcoal and chili.

00:01:02.253 --> 00:01:03.611
- Charcoal's really good for you though.

00:01:03.611 --> 00:01:04.889
- It smells fantastic.

00:01:04.889 --> 00:01:08.671
I bet it tastes like (bleep).

00:01:08.671 --> 00:01:10.171
- Oh, it's so bad.

00:01:11.577 --> 00:01:12.778
- Oh.

00:01:12.778 --> 00:01:14.312
(screaming)

00:01:14.312 --> 00:01:17.770
- Oh, you look scary AF.

00:01:17.770 --> 00:01:18.681
- Thank you.

00:01:18.681 --> 00:01:20.623
- Why am I doing this,
why am I doing this?

00:01:20.623 --> 00:01:22.074
