to me, I gotta be real.

00:01:37.203 --> 00:01:38.173
- Oh yeah, it smells like toothpaste.

00:01:38.173 --> 00:01:40.054
- I love the toothpaste
flavored toothpaste.

00:01:40.054 --> 00:01:41.418
- Okay.
